        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Kim So-hyun, Sun Woong\n- Products: Ma Boy\n- Organizations: Tooniverse\n- Concepts: South Korean television series, teen drama, child actress\n\nFacts:\n- Kim So-hyun was born on June 4, 1999, and she is a South Korean actress.\n- Kim So-hyun began her career as a child actress in 2006.\n- In 2012, Kim So-hyun gained public attention for playing a villainous young queen-to-be in \"Moon Embracing the Sun.\"\n- In 2012, \"Ma Boy\" was released as a South Korean television series starring Kim So-hyun and Sun Woong.\n- \"Ma Boy\" was the first teen drama aired by Tooniverse.\n- In 2013, Kim So-hyun gained public attention for playing a girl who falls into tragedy in \"Missing You.\"",
